00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.210
Seeing you off.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:20.620
Spare me.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.540
Well, we want to.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.290
Good luck!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.380
Good luck at the competition.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.350
I saw it on the calendar.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:34.680
Thanks!

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:37.770
Later.

