00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:30.670
"Okayama Prefecture's Senior High School"
"Water Polo Tournament"

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:36.840
Yeah!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.970
Yes!

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:39.600
Nice shot, Chinu!

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:42.430
Rikka Gakuen                                    Michioka Girls' High

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:48.100
You all worked hard to get here.
Not that I've seen practice.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:49.310
Episode 11:           Pass! Pass to Me!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.070
Anyway, give it all you've got.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:54.320
I dunno the rules, though.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.610
That's all.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.280
Right...

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.700
I'll learn 'em before the match.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.910
So inspiring.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.500
Don't say that.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.750
Still...

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:11.590
Hey, Babi! You bring chocolate today?

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:15.050
I did, but...

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:18.050
Have it, but I don't want any.

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.850
Hey, Captain!

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:21.390
Hmm?

00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:26.690
What's the deal with these jerseys?
How the hell did this happen?!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:26.720
"Strange"

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:29.650
There was a little drama involved.

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:31.440
--Mmm!
--Huh?

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.820
You guys are rocking the look.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:35.030
Huh?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.530
But you still suck at water polo.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:40.370
Eh?!

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.110
"Rikka Gakuen"

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.160
Quit it, Toyama.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.830
We wish you luck today.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.500
Likewise.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:49.210
One of us will have our first victory.

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:51.960
Given those jerseys, it'll be us.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.170
Say what?!

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:53.920
Hey!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.670
Huh?

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:58.010
You talk big for wimps.

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:02.930
You cried in middle school
when I scored ten on you.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.430
Did your memory--?

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:08.850
I remember everything.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.060
I've changed since then.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.650
Oh?

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:17.740
And your team's not like it
used to be. I ain't afraid!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.120
Later.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:52.350
Hey, you wear that for games?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:53.650
Yeah.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:58.530
That's gotta restrict his hips.

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:03.070
These guys are amateurs.
I'll have to step up--

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.420
Looking forward to your match.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.880
42nd Chugoku Wind Orchestra Summer Competition

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:31.480
Hey, how long is a match?

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:34.850
Each period is eight minutes,
and there're four.

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.020
So, 32 minutes?

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:43.030
No. For each foul in water polo,
the game clock is stopped.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:48.080
Since you can't shoot, but have
to pass to resume the game,

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:48.570
{=4}Rikka Gakuen

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:48.570
{=3}Yamanami High School

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:52.870
the stoppage adds up,
so it's like 15 minutes a period.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:56.330
After the 1st and 3rd,
there's a two-minute break.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:06:01.340
There's also halftime with a 15-minute
break, so it's about an hour.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:05.260
All without touching the bottom?
Sounds rough.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:07.050
Yeah.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:11.930
Uh, sorry!

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:18.610
This time, Minato's our enemy.
Don't cheer for him.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:21.610
"Shogakukan"

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.530
Yeah, I know.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.820
"Yoshiharu"

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:39.540
So the goofy-haired guy is
their fastest swimmer, huh?

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.630
It's all you, Amihama.

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:59.610
Way to go, Amiami! Now,
let's get the ball to Minato...!

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:04.950
There're six covering him?!

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:08.910
We saw how reliant you are on Kiyomizu!

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:12.580
If we shut him down,
there's nothing to fear!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:25.970
Um, you get 30 seconds to shoot
when you have possession.

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:28.220
How long is left?

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:29.890
Five seconds?!

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.180
Chase him!

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.770
H-Huh?

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:39.520
Time's up?

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:49.200
I'm gonna stop--!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.790
Rikka Gakuen

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.790
Yamanami High School

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:10.430
I've gotta do something!

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:20.310
Pass! Pass!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:21.980
Pass to me!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.990
Um, where to pass...?

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:50.840
Rikka Gakuen

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:50.840
Yamanami High School

00:08:56.430 --> 00:09:01.690
What are you doing? Just let me
attack while you guys counter!

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.100
--Okay!
--Right!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:07.280
Ushimado, let's swap who we're guarding.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:09.820
You're up against a good swimmer.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.150
Yeah...

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:17.280
"Okayama Prefecture's Senior High School"
"Water Polo Tournament"

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:22.960
Not good. Nothing's changed
in the second period.

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:29.460
Your brother guarding Toyama
prevented more points, but...

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:33.470
Yamanami is showing no signs of scoring.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:37.350
You're gonna lose at this rate, Minato.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:45.190
C'mon! Let's defend this and counter!

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:50.110
You won't get past me!

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:56.870
A screen? They changed defenders!

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.040
Huh? Isn't he...?

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.880
Rikka Gakuen

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.880
Yamanami High School

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:18.470
Argh! Gimme some space! Piss off!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:21.800
Our ball!

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.390
Shit!

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:27.520
Aww, a foul on us? Ah!

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.280
Rikka Gakuen

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.280
Yamanami High School

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:41.080
Oh, man...

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:50.300
Shoot. If they pull ahead any more...

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:52.380
Can I pass to you?

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:56.970
Huh? And where would you
throw it? They're all over me.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.550
How about up?

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.100
Huh?

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:03.890
You can jump higher than anyone.

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:07.900
I've watched you, so I know.

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:12.400
You can out-jump 'em.
I'll toss it just above.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.460
Is this really gonna work?

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.770
This guy! So high!

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:03.290
Go!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.040
Go!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:24.850
Sorry.

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:26.390
Huh?

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:29.440
It was a better pass than I expected.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.940
Uh, it's okay.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.490
I underestimated them.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:44.830
Not our opponent, but my teammates.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.830
Good luck, Yamanami

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.380
Hey, let's keep our heads up.

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:57.880
Any big plans for the next half?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.550
No...

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:04.220
Sorry. What a useless captain I am.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:10.060
You've stopped a ton
of shots. That's plenty.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:16.820
Try shooting, Ejiri.

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:17.690
Huh?

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:20.110
Forget about me and shoot.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:24.280
If they give you the middle,
let's put on the pressure.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.790
I'll make more space for you.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:27.910
But...

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:32.120
Not many people can throw
as hard as you do.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:35.210
Right?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.290
He perked up.

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.920
Shuddap!

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:42.510
Are you gassed out, Amihama?

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.180
As if.

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:47.680
Then let's have you out-swim everyone.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:52.980
I was just about to suggest that myself.

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.360
Of course you were.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:11.960
This way!

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:15.460
Come defend me!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:22.010
Now, shoot! I'll get the rebound!

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.560
Hell yeah!

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:34.770
--Woo-hoo!
--Nice!

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:38.400
That was perfect.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.940
That was awesome, Buu!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.700
Hmm?

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:55.330
Dad... To tell you the truth,
I play water polo at school.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:15:02.380
Hello?! Yes! Um, I sent a message
explaining why I'll be late! No, no! Yeah!

00:14:55.330 --> 00:15:02.380
I'm actually the captain. We've got a
tourney today and I'm really nervous.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:03.960
Thank you!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:07.050
I kinda regret not asking
you for advice.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:14.230
Anyway, I didn't want to play today
while hiding it from you.

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:16.310
I want to play with my head held high.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.440
Hey, taxi!

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:25.950
I'll give it my best today. Jo.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.830
He gave way?

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:48.920
Rikka Gakuen

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:48.920
Yamanami High School

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:56.480
Get him! He's gonna shoot!

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:19.330
Yeah!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:26.170
There it is! His feint shot!

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:32.510
Hands up! Hands up!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.940
I've got no shot!

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.810
Three seconds!

