00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:20.140
Rikka Gakuen

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:20.140
Yamanami High School

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:25.150
The last period... Tie score...

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.780
Lez do this!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.570
Fifteen seconds left!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:07.630
Nice! I'll pull Fukui away
so Minato can score!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.920
Huh?!

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:17.930
Shoot it, Eitaro!

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:27.400
I did it!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:28.180
Yamanami High School

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.830
We won!

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:50.130
We really won!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:57.010
Hell yeah!

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:59.930
Our first win...!

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:02.010
Jo!

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:07.600
Way to go!

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:16.740
"Absolute Victory"
"Rikka Gakuen Senior High School Water Polo Club"

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:25.330
Sorry. We didn't win once in middle
school or with me as vice-captain.

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:28.670
I had fun. No regrets here.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:36.840
Guys, we've still gotta play Shogaku!
Let's win the next one!

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.470
Absolutely.

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:48.020
Going up against Minato, huh? Feels weird.

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:49.770
Yeah.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:54.400
I'm envious that you guys get to play him.

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:58.060
"Shogakukan"

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:10.040
He changed during the match...
I've never seen a Minato like this.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:18.010
Whew! You guys did great! At this rate,
maybe we'll crush Shogakukan!

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:19.550
Nah...

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:22.140
It's not gonna be that easy.

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:26.430
I see. Well, try to rest up. That's all.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.060
Right.

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:33.520
Well, I'm taking a nap.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:34.520
Hmm?

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:37.690
There're two hours
till the game to recover.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.490
I see.

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:44.410
I'm sorry, guys.

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:47.830
All I do is screw up.

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:49.250
That's not true.

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:50.580
That's right!

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:52.120
Mmm!

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:55.880
But I can't do anything.

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:58.510
You did just fine.

00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:03.840
You kept your hands up till the end.
It's basic, but important.

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:14.980
It really is just like I said...

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:17.770
Teamwork is our best weapon.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:24.320
One person can't carry us to victory.
We're a team that works together.

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:26.950
The other me, that is.

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:30.910
<i>Laughing</i>

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:38.420
<i>All the many sights and</i>

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:41.880
<i>All the words you left behind</i>

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:48.680
<i>Are looking a little warped</i>

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:52.100
<i>Someone, anyone tell me</i>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>It hurts, it hurts, it hurts</i>

00:22:55.060 --> 00:23:03.400
<i>What am I suddenly crying for?</i>
